full_judgment:
(i) That a decree be passed declaring that the plaintiff is the sole owner of lot Nos. 1 and 2 of schedule Ka by registered sale deed and to make a note to that effect in the connected volume of the register of deed in the Sub-Registrar's Office; 

 (ii) That a decree be passed declaring that the plaintiff is the sole owner of lot No.3 of Ka schedule land, buildings, machineries, furniture and fixtures and the defendant Nos.1, 2, 4 and 5 have no right, title and possession in that land, 

 (iii) That a decree be passed declaring that the defendant No.5 collusively and fraudulently started "Kha" Schedule certificate case. 

 (iv) That a decree be passed declaring that the certificate case is a collusive and fraudulent one; 

 (v) That a decree be passed declaring that the plaintiff did not receive any loan on behalf of Joy Textile Mill from defendant Nos. 1 and 2.
